# Where the runtime writes when DATA_DIR is unset, which is "." by default.
# An ad-hoc `python3 -c` against any tool - a sandbox call, a transcript write -
# drops its files here, and two ledger entries for temporary directories that
# stopped existing in September were committed that way. The test suite sets
# DATA_DIR to a temporary directory of its own, so nothing here is ever wanted.
/ledger/
/journal/
/transcripts/
/context/
/workspaces/
/uploads/
